flowchart LR
    user["User / BrowserUI"]
    facade["SeparationService<br/><b>Facade</b>"]
    model["ModelService<br/>selected or active model"]
    factory["SeparationAlgorithmFactory<br/><b>Factory Method</b>"]
    strategy["SeparationAlgorithm<br/><b>Strategy interface</b>"]
    neossnet["NeoSSNetStrategy<br/>real NeoSSNet implementation"]
    output["heart.wav + lung.wav"]

    user -->|separate request| facade
    facade -->|get model| model
    model -->|architecture| factory
    facade -->|create model| factory
    factory -->|returns| strategy
    factory -->|creates| neossnet
    neossnet -. implements .-> strategy
    facade -->|run separation| strategy
    strategy --> output

    classDef facadeStyle fill:#dcecff,stroke:#2f5f98,stroke-width:2px
    classDef factoryStyle fill:#e4f7e7,stroke:#3d7c49,stroke-width:2px
    classDef strategyStyle fill:#fff1cc,stroke:#a66a00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef neutral fill:#ffffff,stroke:#2f3a4a
    class facade facadeStyle
    class model,factory factoryStyle
    class strategy,neossnet strategyStyle
    class user,output neutral
